[{"title":"醉蓬莱 秀城元夕","author":"刘一止","text":"正官桥柳润，候馆梅开，暮云凄冽。\n泽国春归，是烧灯时节。\n吹绽红蕖，挽低星斗，共水光澄澈。\n霜瓦楼台，参差似与，蓬壶相接。\n千骑遨游，万家嬉笑，帘卷东风，弄妆成列。\n慢舞尊前，看轻盈回雪。\n来岁今宵，舜韶声里，对六鳌双阙。\n凤检飞来，玉骢去踏，青门华月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27836,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鹧鸪天","author":"刘一止","text":"岩下清阴引兴长。\n坐中初识令君香。\n揽将风月归诗薮，乞得溪山作醉乡。\n怜我老，与传觞。\n吴霜点鬓又何妨。\n只应银烛交红夜，羞对双歌发彩光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27837,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花发状元红慢","author":"刘几","text":"三春向暮，万卉成阴、有嘉艳方坼。\n娇姿嫩质。\n冠群品，共赏倾城倾国。\n上苑晴昼暄，千素万红尤奇特。\n绮筵开，会咏歌才子，压倒元白。\n别有芳幽苞小，步障华丝，绮轩油壁。\n与紫鸳鸯、素蛱蝶。\n自清旦、往往连夕。\n巧莺喧翠管，娇燕语雕梁留客。\n武陵人，念梦役意浓，堪遣情溺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27838,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花曲 以介父三诗度曲 其一","author":"刘几","text":"汉宫中侍女，娇额半涂黄。\n盈盈粉色凌时，寒玉体、先透薄妆。\n好借月魂来，娉婷画烛旁。\n惟恐随、阳春好梦去，所思飞扬。\n宜向风亭把盏，酬孤艳，醉永夕何妨。\n雪径蕊、真凝密，降回舆、认暗香。\n不为藉我作和羹，肯放结子花狂。\n向上林，留此占年芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27839,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花曲 其二","author":"刘几","text":"结子非贪，有香不俗，宜当鼎鼐尝。\n偶先红紫，度韶华、玉笛占年芳。\n众花杂色满上林，未能教、腊雪埋藏。\n却怕春风漏泄，一一尽天香。\n不须更御铅黄。\n知国色，禀自天真殊常。\n只裁云缕，奈芳滑、玉体想仙妆。\n少陵为尔东阁。\n美艳激诗肠。\n当已阴未雨春光。\n无心赋海棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27840,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花曲 其三","author":"刘几","text":"浅浅池塘。\n深深庭院，复出短短垣墙。\n年年为尔，若九真巡会、宝惜流芳。\n向人自有，绵渺无言，深意深藏。\n倾国倾城，天教与、抵死芳香。\n袅须金色，轻危欲压，绰约冠中央。\n蒂团红蜡，兰肌粉艳巧能妆。\n婵娟一种风流，如雪如冰衣霓裳。\n永日依倚，春风笑野棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27841,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏郢州","author":"刘三戒","text":"百年宋玉石，三里莫愁乡。\n地接荆门近，烟迷汉水长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27842,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自陈诗","author":"刘三嘏","text":"虽惭涔勺赴沧溟，仰诉丹衷不为名。\n寅分星辰将降祸，兑方疆宇即交兵。\n春秋大义惟观衅，王者雄师但有征。\n救得燕民归旧主，免于戎肤自称兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27843,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兰陵王 赋胡伯雨别业","author":"刘之才","text":"此何夕。\n天水空明一碧。\n商量赋、如此江山，几个斜阳了今昔。\n荒台步晚色。\n沙鸟依稀曾识。\n啼鸧外，人远未归，江阔晴虹卧千尺。\n残碑藓痕积。\n记当日清游，夫君题墨。\n碧瑶仙去苍云隔。\n飞一镜秋冷，列屏天远，鸡声人语半郊邑。\n寄情又江国。\n愁寂。\n怕闻笛。\n正怨苦溪猿，飞倦汀翼。\n阴阴翡翠迷津驿。\n慨世事尘化，吾心形役。\n清吟孤往，渺醉影，夜翠湿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27844,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"声声慢 五日","author":"刘之才","text":"湘云纤玉，楚葛篝香，澡兰帘幕风静。\n怨抑难招，沉魄当年独醒。\n莫唱江南古调，念天涯、深情谁省。\n时暗换，最秦楼惆望，归期无定。\n曾是榴裙误写，怕照眼枝头，绛绡花并。\n巧篆盘丝，午镜绿窗闹影。\n香蒲也应细剪，但年年、断云愁冷。\n迎醉面，看银蟾、飞浴露井。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27845,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玲珑四犯","author":"刘之才","text":"几叠云山，隔不断阑干，天外凝眺。\n秋与愁并，梧径雨痕先表。\n娇梦半握芙蓉，奈曲曲、翠屏深窈。\n问愁根，当年谁种，漠漠淡烟衰草。\n鸳鸯懒拂苹花影，记眉妩、萦情多少。\n辘轳玉虎牵丝转，听尽秋釭晓。\n算谁念、卧云衣冷，香压金蟾小。\n写新词、先寄江鸿归去，且教知道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27846,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺新郎 忆鹤","author":"刘之才","text":"苍藓粘溪路。\n帐山君、翛然羽化，梦魂何许。\n曾约秋云萦客袖，舞傍吟皋砚坞。\n矫清唳、裂穿云宇。\n江碧空濛无处问，问孤山、梅底人知否。\n烟夜永，耿心语。\n瑶华一去成幽阻。\n倚修篁、抱琴愁绝，天寒日暮。\n城郭悲歌华表恨，此事销凝千古。\n有招隐、小山能赋。\n蕙帐空兮谁夜怨，算课骚、读易俱凄楚。\n步深窈，堕松露。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27847,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮","author":"刘之才","text":"题花曾蘸花心露。\n当初误结丁香树。\n往事小蛮窗。\n新愁桃叶江。\n缓歌留薄醉。\n急镫人千里。\n梅瘦月阑干。\n断云春梦寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27848,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"解连环","author":"刘之才","text":"晚云粘湿。\n正吴峰惨澹，雨迷烟接。\n早陡顿、秋事分携，甚连苑暮墙，菊荒苔匝。\n空阔愁乡，更天外、怨鸿声黠。\n怕吟肩易瘦，料理篝衣，细认香折。\n银缸半明半灭。\n念花营柳阵，何日消歇。\n可是□、凝黯兰成，为情润才松，丽赋多惬。\n洛浦溟濛，漫伫想、明珰钩袜。\n告梧桐、夜深略住，梦时一霎。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27849,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 献田都统","author":"刘之翰","text":"凉露洗金井，一叶下梧桐。\n谪仙浪游，何事华发作诗翁。\n乌帽萧萧一幅，坐对清泉白石，矫首抚长松。\n独鹤归来晚，声在碧霄中。\n神仙宅，留玉节，驻金狨。\n黔南一道，十万貔虎控雕弓。\n笑折碧荷倒影，自唱采莲新曲，词句满秋风。\n剑佩八千岁，长入大明宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27850,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和漕司小红翠亭 其二","author":"刘士季","text":"苑在中巴东复东，满城春色一园中。\n休言小小莺花界，也胜纤纤燕麦风。\n舞袖卷纱空映翠，晴窗磨镜漫晞红。\n叶成帷幄花成阵，壮观诗坛矍铄翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27851,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵和漕司小红翠亭 其一","author":"刘士季","text":"少陵遗迹瀼西东，端的高斋在此中。\n今日花枝弄烟雨，前时蔬甲卧霜风。\n根株移取他山翠，跗萼输来别圃红。\n收拾阳春无尽藏，夔人端说两诗翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鉴轩","author":"刘大纲","text":"一泓清澈底，明可烛须眉。\n漾月摇金影，涵风皱绿漪。\n台高悬宝鉴，水定照摩尼。\n宴坐宜临赋，难忘此段奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧沼寺 其二","author":"刘大纲","text":"地僻人稀到，唐贤句尚存。\n观鱼寻曲沼，吊古入名园。\n山翠沾夜袂，苔纹印屐痕。\n暂陪尊俎乐，箫鼓出丘樊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧沼寺 其一","author":"刘大纲","text":"夜色清无滓，虚凉月满亭。\n萤飞时度竹，鱼跃乍翻萍。\n冉冉云归尽，霏霏露欲零。\n剧谈浑得趣，相对两忘形。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27855,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"刘大辨","text":"凌云多少功业。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27856,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"资深堂","author":"刘大辩","text":"古人学道怕求深，善学长于浅处寻。\n日用至粗存至赜，须知瓦砾是黄金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27857,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷山钟模石","author":"刘子羽","text":"谁铸三钟栾乳形，不须笋簴自能鸣。\n仙君欲奏宾云曲，只感清霜便发声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27858,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题瑞岩扣冰古佛","author":"刘子羽","text":"古木千章覆地阴，微风披拂递幽吟。\n化身大士久圆寂，归命群黎无古今。\n能使兵戈长偃息，要知愿力本宏深。\n中原赤子方鱼肉，愿广当年济物心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27859,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"刘子羽","text":"赵州柏树太无端，境上追寻也大难。\n处处绿杨堪系马，家家门底透长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27860,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽忠烈刘侯","author":"刘子实","text":"樵水孤军血战时，英雄失援最堪悲。\n那知惯把鲸鲵戮，到底翻为鸟鼠欺。\n堆垒誓当阴灭贼，崤陵休恨不全师。\n生封死庙男儿事，今有祠前堕泪碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27861,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 寿太守十二月十三日","author":"刘子实","text":"腊后寒收，柳眼青归，梅花笑生。\n正阳和有脚，日边送暖，洪钧换轴，天上回星。\n试巧春盘，介眉春酒，生意从头乐意新。\n须知道，是东风近也，玉燕逢辰。\n举头阊阖开明。\n便稳驾轻车熟路行。\n向玉堂青琐，从容洒翰，长淮赤壁，谈笑麾兵。\n周洛犹尘，商岩未雨，天下苍生望太平。\n休盘涧，任清溪九曲，不放舟横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27862,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"念奴娇 寿仓使","author":"刘子实","text":"一门相种，剩河英岳粹，共扶昌箓。\n夹辅正宜资鲁卫，左右秉持钧轴。\n缓驾轻车，任回虎节，何事劳山国。\n东民欲靖，作新少借康叔。\n况是鸑鷟佳辰，雪霜深处，秀孕椿松绿。\n天意特教荣晚节，挺挺世臣乔木。\n绣斧功成，衮衣促觐，莫恨公归速。\n一陶和气，要令天下蒙福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27863,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游老君洞 其二","author":"刘子荐","text":"怪怪奇奇画不如，最难得者近城郛。\n他仙皆逊老君有，此洞可知天下无。\n徐甲青牛骖左侍，六丁白鹤导前驱。\n老仙笑我来何晚，一样须眉一样臞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27864,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游老君洞 其一","author":"刘子荐","text":"第一真岩岂浪名，高明洞达窈而深。\n冠天下神仙胜境，副我生山水知音。\n崖激湍流腾雪玉，灯摇石瑩灿星金。\n少焉月出东山上，何必蓬莱海上寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27865,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"下滩","author":"刘子翚","text":"乱石槎牙泻怒涛，满船性命等鸿毛。\n莫誇好手翻成误，寄语舟人稳著篙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27866,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山馆偶题","author":"刘子翚","text":"水绕山堂竹映桥，偶来尘意已潜消。\n最怜晓日浮波影，满壁煌煌玉电摇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27867,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中渡","author":"刘子翚","text":"渡南渡北是长亭，沙上行人立马情。\n回首若无烟树隔，只应犹望见高城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27868,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其九 灯檠","author":"刘子翚","text":"代木收奇干，安灯创小檠。\n勿誇能自照，得助益高明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27869,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其四 纸拂","author":"刘子翚","text":"拂儿虽草创，日用最相亲。\n莫遣维摩室，潜生庾亮尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27870,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其五 图书","author":"刘子翚","text":"惭非苏子佩，聊置简书间。\n尺牍予慵理，何劳汝汗颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27871,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其七 界方","author":"刘子翚","text":"抄书防纵逸，界墨作遮阑。\n妙用谁能识，心端笔自端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27872,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其三 唤铁","author":"刘子翚","text":"号令行惟信，人谁不我承。\n举烽诸国叛，敲铁小童应。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27873,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其一 笔架","author":"刘子翚","text":"刻画峰峦势，尸功翰墨馀。\n锁窗閒昼永，高卧数中书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27874,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其二 剪刀","author":"刘子翚","text":"错落双刀合，晶荧百鍊光。\n剪裁皆在手，终不露锋铓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27875,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书斋十咏 其十 榰案木","author":"刘子翚","text":"匠馀留片木，榰案定攲倾。\n不是乖绳墨，人间地少平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27876,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天迥","author":"刘子翚","text":"天迥孤帆隐约归，茫茫残照欲沉西。\n寒鸦散乱知多少，飞向江头一树栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27877,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家","author":"刘子翚","text":"长空淡淡如云扫，暮过田家风物好。\n耕犁倚户寂无人，饥牛卧齧墙根草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27878,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石磨","author":"刘子翚","text":"盘石轮囷隐涧幽，烟笼月照几经秋。\n可怜琢作团团磨，终日随人转不休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27879,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其十 密庵","author":"刘子翚","text":"曾访高人上翠峰，至今清兴逐松风。\n篮舆梦想行山处，白葛花开细雨中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27880,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其九 翁德功","author":"刘子翚","text":"翁侯满腹是精神，三谒金门计未成。\n却跨蹇驴游霅上，秋风雄剑匣中鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27881,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其八 周元仲","author":"刘子翚","text":"马蹴浮埃去路长，相逢端欲问行藏。\n未饶赤壁风流在，且向何家醉碧香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27882,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其七 傅茂元","author":"刘子翚","text":"松底柴门尽日关，主人西去几时还。\n长镵委地黄精老，时有寒猿啸砚山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27883,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其六 张巨山","author":"刘子翚","text":"青钱学士妙文章，便合含毫侍帝傍。\n寂寂闽山馀旧隐，忆君时到读书堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27884,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其五 吴公路","author":"刘子翚","text":"风惊枯苇白花浮，欲下横桥晚更留。\n惆怅不逢吴季子，一溪寒水带烟流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27885,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其四 郑尚明","author":"刘子翚","text":"当年册府仰才华，一跌青云万里赊。\n白首却来莲社里，幅巾缁褐诵楞伽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27886,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其三 刘致中","author":"刘子翚","text":"山空坠石咽寒溪，雨湿浮云晚更低。\n不见萧屯刘处士，年年清梦绕瓜畦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27887,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其二 刘温其","author":"刘子翚","text":"结茅同隐水云间，何日柴车不往还。\n忆得松林长啸罢，归时明月遍秋山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27888,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有怀十首 其一 胡原仲","author":"刘子翚","text":"满空寒雨杂飞烟，湖上先生拥褐眠。\n借问茅斋容客否，夜灯相伴读韦编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27889,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"刘子翚","text":"抱石亲征泽潞时，艰难犹想旧开基。\n官军不守河阳渡，回首桥山泪欲垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27890,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题四首 其四","author":"刘子翚","text":"宿雁犹惊渚，昏鸦已著林。\n野平云散乱，江动月浮沈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27891,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题四首 其三","author":"刘子翚","text":"檐溜停清泻，林声息怒号。\n水浮秋色远，山带夕阳高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27892,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题四首 其二","author":"刘子翚","text":"残霞销暝色，新月长圆辉。\n黄落树滋本，夜眠人息机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27893,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂题四首 其一","author":"刘子翚","text":"积雨生秋意，浮阴放晚晴。\n钟声寒野迥，桥影小溪清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27894,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其四","author":"刘子翚","text":"闻道清湖别有春，花边玉笋想长身。\n怪来几日诗筒少，尽写瑰奇赋洛神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27895,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其三","author":"刘子翚","text":"偶随流水到僧家，身世浑如焦谷芽。\n午梦不知缘底破，篆烟烧遍一盘花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27896,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其一","author":"刘子翚","text":"桃花偏傍谪仙居，点缀高岩今几株。\n力士铛边欠何物，著鞭跨马是狂图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27897,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其八","author":"刘子翚","text":"春来太半在农畴，邂逅相逢皆饮流。\n贪看暮烟驰万柳，不知明月上前洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27898,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其九","author":"刘子翚","text":"庾郎食事惟三九，适口方知味味珍。\n拟欲招邀无此客，虎头不是个中人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27899,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其七","author":"刘子翚","text":"酒恶时来漱浅溪，玉池汩汩自生肥。\n游鯈岂解吾曹意，聊复蓬头坐钓矶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27900,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其十","author":"刘子翚","text":"辽鹤归来本姓丁，咿哑几见弄文绷。\n人间过眼事如许，何用封侯羡戛羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27901,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其二","author":"刘子翚","text":"饭了呼童叠石门，雨馀幽事不胜繁。\n花残不用深惆怅，梧竹新阴又满园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27902,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵六四叔村居即事十二绝 其五","author":"刘子翚","text":"潭边春水碧于苔，为听泠泠溪畔来。\n不耐颠风阻人兴，渔舟欲上又吹开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":27903,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]